      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "8410598774",
        "text": "=🚨 *AI SECURITY ALERT* 🚨\n\n🎯 *Target:* {{$json.message}}\n\n🧠 *Decision:* {{$json.decision}}\n🔥 *Priority:* {{$json.priority}} ({{$json.severity}})\n\n🧬 *Threat Type:* {{$json.threat_type}}\n🎯 *Attack Stage:* {{$json.attack_stage}}\n\n📊 *Risk Score:* {{$json.score}}\n\n🧠 *Reason:*\n{{$json.reason}}\n\n⚙️ *Automation:*\n🚫 Block: {{$json.block}}\n📣 Notify: {{$json.notify}}\n🎫 Ticket: {{$json.ticket}}\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤖 Automated SOC System\n",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
